{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "cfc900136aeaab5d9d71f2e18aefcd0f49062ef6582b4b0a4d05e3f3628d5ddd", "ja": "環と『うちあわせ』", "zh": "和环“商量”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1d67452ae75ea00b4a907f2c7ce6610586163f872e62d6f984d80237c1e1cead", "ja": "番組出演に向け南の島の思い出を語る環。\n今は仕事の準備『うちあわせ』なことに\n気付いてブレーキをかけるが、楽しそうに\n話す姿こそ満点とプロデューサーに告げら\nれて、環のおしゃべりは加速するのだった。", "zh": "为了参加节目，环讲述着南方小岛的回忆。  \n意识到现在是在为工作做准备，进行『碰头会』，  \n她踩下了刹车，可制作人告诉她，  \n这样开心地讲述才是满分表现，  \n于是环的话匣子又加速打开了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "9cc3256283420183993921ac144c0491b184c43b789e19d5bddf366125b5478b", "ja": "環との打ち合わせ……", "zh": "与环的商谈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "ddeeda6dd87c05e31225dc1378f3e1e5af002bc9a5f2f8079d743a24a28249f1", "ja": "おやぶんおやぶん！\n『うちあわせ』って、なにするの？", "zh": "老大老大！\n“碰头会”是要做什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "fdb59690c5d6cb1fbcf6a4845a65540744c89aad4ab02032e54ef379a6f3d7ed", "ja": "俺と一緒に、次の仕事の準備をするんだよ。\n大事な説明もあるから、話はよく聞いてくれよ！", "zh": "要和我一起准备接下来的工作。\n还有重要的说明，要好好听我说哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "9f9d3e70b98853bed5c4563bb7ab7cab786cb91a7d7e8eac517c69a0ea44a381", "ja": "まず、テレビ局はすごく広くて大きい所なんだ。\nはぐれて迷子にならないよう、気を付けるんだぞ！", "zh": "首先，电视台是一个非常大、非常宽敞的地方。\n注意别走散迷路了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "3fb696bf73724a74083cee94a61ff403412cb07d8735f36d708336ec8935297b", "ja": "テレビ局って、広くて大きいんだ？\nたまき、探検したい！", "zh": "电视台原来又宽敞又大吗？\n环，想去探险！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "d1fe70fbd7edf6387533d9440577e9e458e143297e4addf8250759278327e37d", "ja": "えっ。いや、入っちゃダメな所もあるから……！\n俺と一緒の時に、ちょっとだけな？", "zh": "咦。不行，有些地方不能进去……！\n和我一起的时候，只能稍微逛一下哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "ea578df521e44723ec31247bf7d61166d819e51ecbad9d2eccf6fb8780e21759", "ja": "じゃあ、おやぶんが探検隊の隊長ね！\n見たことない動物と会えるかな～？　くふふ♪", "zh": "那老大就是探险队队长啦！\n不知道能不能遇到从没见过的动物呢～？咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "7ed9f32c2410d8ff3922e073e2a6d61936446a9d6eaa90a455c2d87af8f93956", "ja": "動物はどうかな……。あ、もしかしたら、\n動物番組の、何かすごく珍しいのに会えるかもな！", "zh": "动物嘛……不好说。不过，说不定还能遇到动物节目里那种特别稀有的动物呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "3e1fca74fabc457b84c4f37845406c5f047fd2197db0599e526a9c2c45c5e920", "ja": "ホント！？　楽しみだぞ～！\nデビューバトルみたいなアスレチックもできる？", "zh": "真的！？好期待啊～！\n也能参加像出道对决那样的竞技项目吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "567bfd3374e0161de9045501e6f3723f044590819a16fb2b552d10d407a72fcc", "ja": "アスレチックはさすがに……。あ、もしかしたら、\nバラエティ用のすごいセットがあるかもしれない！", "zh": "竞技项目就有点……不过，说不定会有专门为综艺节目准备的超厉害布景！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "adc6c15ad8854f5006e82a12ec8ef059aba1e26d15af7b8a81afc3e8795054ca", "ja": "ホント！？　テレビ局ってすごいね、おやぶん！\nまた、みんなと競争できるかな～？", "zh": "真的吗！？电视台真厉害啊，老大！还能再和大家比赛吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "36b39caeb623afd10e251da23f56f94cfa91f29a7c8b9411294c24f0c77c7e99", "ja": "はは、環は南の島でも走り回って大活躍だったもんな。", "zh": "哈哈，环在南方小岛上也跑来跑去，大显身手了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "aeb40b336a5988bfc05fc81226d9e7efab92d39a704343eb4ceb5e7ae1dba42d", "ja": "うん！　うみみとヒトデ見つけたんだぞ～！\nえっへん！", "zh": "嗯！我和海美一起找到了海星哦～！\n得意吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "a5cf348a6cd2092139eb80f3d17d5739afb2260a277a53999edc9ae02c83924c", "ja": "あとね、ウツボと友達になったり、大きな貝を拾ったり\nおっきなナメクジみたいなのも見つけたんだ♪", "zh": "还有啊，我们还和海鳝交上了朋友，捡到了好大的贝壳，\n还发现了像大鼻涕虫一样的大虫子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "a23beff78be3c30a6579e64ccafc2de5541afe3f6df65573f803a7a2dbb8204b", "ja": "それから、こーんなおっきい虫も捕まえたの！\nことりもみさきもビックリしてたぞ！　くふふ♪", "zh": "然后，我还抓到了这么——大的一只虫子！  \n小鸟和美咲都吓了一跳！嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "03b25fafdee250ba8e9300d3d1dd781c399923667b656ad1fef682d41bf47e24", "ja": "……そっか。\n楽しい思い出がいっぱいできたみたいだな。", "zh": "……这样啊。\n看来留下了很多开心的回忆呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "ad16deafe515d61dce6c40a7b799b70716da526cca61c97a31f35c9619e7f54c", "ja": "うん！　あとあと、山の中に……あっ。\n……ごめんなさい、おやぶん……。", "zh": "嗯！还有还有，在山里……啊。\n……对不起，老大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "ed928b9ae15b8c01ffa5b4746ef590b16bab35c6f9bc60423d90eab83e471a52", "ja": "え？　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "诶？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "ea1a46a4e74c3084cf97ba0ffb4265235eb7f9f8bf90b8e30523140498af5232", "ja": "たまき、ひとりでおしゃべりしちゃった……。\n『うちあわせ』って、お仕事の準備なのに……。", "zh": "环，独自一个人说起来了……\n明明“碰头会”是为了准备工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "db733555b51bcc8231b759145511cf264cab11628d91e19830898d7587c39049", "ja": "……。いいや、今のでバッチリだ。\n100点満点だよ！", "zh": "……不，刚才那样就很好。\n给你打100分满分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "cdae2167b9d1525fc9f614b115310c552f0a949862974344dd343011dc62b1c6", "ja": "え？　そうなの？", "zh": "咦？是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "7432e90e80e07d29ad595bc8b99e5dad55e59db5776b7effb2d1f1e09a813393", "ja": "うん、テレビに出て、お話をするのが次の仕事だから。\n今の環は、本当に楽しそうに話してくれた。", "zh": "嗯，因为下次的工作是要上电视说话。\n刚才的环，聊得真的看起来好开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1023_401pro", "source_sha256": "8fdf44dc0d12763ccc506e70dcec55971793766a38e785f764ea7e97d8353b77", "ja": "あれなら観てる人も楽しく聞いてくれそうだ。\n俺も聞いてて楽しかったからな！", "zh": "那样的话，观众听了一定也会觉得很有趣。\n毕竟我刚才也听得很开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "8fbf74687eb1db62e6b9bad92b3e05f72a45505516fae26037be747dd1fe866a", "ja": "そうなんだ？　えへへ、じゃあ今のお話、\nテレビでもいっぱいするね！", "zh": "这样啊？嘿嘿，那我也会在电视上多讲讲刚才的故事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "fb9e96ae58b7dff4e37cfcb33b64eeee7cb4641ad0390f82d28d606679e7ca04", "ja": "ああ、よろしく頼む！", "zh": "嗯，麻烦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1026_040tam", "source_sha256": "550effa78c8ecd2c84e227ea70d0d2f9c4f6016cce328dab278e115d34132838", "ja": "あ、そしたら、そのあとの話はしないほうがいい？", "zh": "啊，那这样的话，之后的事还是别说比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "ff3cc0cbe507907b4cd8be0fa8d17e15d20ecccf0d174a659e1b766e9285d48c", "ja": "え？　えっと……まだあるのか？", "zh": "诶？那个……后面还有吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1028_040tam", "source_sha256": "f189ff146fdaed8424126f9f8976dfe07d38bca6f5a35bebe6056cb2e3acbc3e", "ja": "いっぱいあるぞ！　帰りの船の中での話とか、港で解散\nする時の話とか、寂しくなってメッセージした話とか！", "zh": "还有很多哦！像是回程船上的事、在港口解散\n时的情景、还有觉得寂寞发消息的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "130192b21de21c814a4c59dc0a8fc21cdeedd2f88a45ea94459dda72529b1244", "ja": "……なるほど。\nどの瞬間も、環には最高の思い出になってるんだな。", "zh": "……原来如此。\n每个瞬间都成了环最棒的回忆啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1030_040tam", "source_sha256": "c820fd53be25adc7648e4275f8b6495dd1df7fc259e63e0431033644c6acc578", "ja": "うんっ！　たまき、劇場にくるたびに\n話したいことが増えるんだ♪", "zh": "嗯！环每次来剧场，\n想说的话都会变多呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0310_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_01_1031_040tam", "source_sha256": "e201a1a5ebf5d4cd7c2cad0e108b918bdc061d2c1aeeb0e3c80663ee50d241ce", "ja": "今日はおやぶんといっぱい話せたでしょ？\n明日はなにが起こるかな～……。くふふ♪", "zh": "今天和大老板聊了好多吧？\n明天会发生什么呢～……咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
